  "changelog": "Initial release of Sentinel-1 GRD tile preprocessing pipeline.\n\n- Provides decibel (dB) conversion, pixel-aligned bbox clipping, and per-polarization processing (dual-pol for IW, optional for EW).\n- Implements physical range QA with customizable dB thresholds; flags out-of-range pixels.\n- Supports both synthetic (offline) and real-mode (local GeoTIFF) data processing.\n- Outputs preprocessed \u03c3\u2070(dB) GeoTIFF, processing log (steps/parameters/statistics), and manifest JSON.\n- Runs fully offline; no data uploads.",
